oal_line, prevent; = base; - cover2; -- man.\n- pass_medium: intermediate throw, 10-18 yards. vs defenses: ++ cover2, goal_line; + base, cover3; = man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- pass_deep: deep shot, 20+ yards (interceptions when it loses). vs defenses: ++ man, goal_line; + blitz; = base; - cover3; -- cover2, prevent.\n- screen: screen to the RB behind the rush. vs defenses: ++ blitz; + cover3, goal_line, prevent; = cover2; - base; -- man.\n- play_action: fake run, then a medium throw (better once 40%+ of your plays have been runs, worse if you never run). vs defenses: ++ base, goal_line; = cover2, cover3, man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- punt / field_goal: kick (choose them yourself on 4th down; a field goal beyond your kicker's range usually misses). Without a valid answer on 4th down you kick.\n- kneel: run out the clock (when ahead late). spike: stop the clock (costs a down).\n- target: preferred receiver for passes (wr1 is the best receiver; \"\" lets the QB choose).\n- tempo: hurry = no huddle, ~12 s between plays (when behind late); milk = use the whole play clock (when ahead late); normal otherwise."},{"n":10,"side":0,"situation":"You are the DEFENSE of Challenger. Q1 11:18 left in the quarter. Score: Challenger 0 - Bot Rookie 0.\nDown: 3 & 18 at the defense's 38 (38 yards to the goal line). Timeouts: you 3, them 3.\nTheir OFFENSE so far: overall: pass_medium 66%, play_action 33% (3 plays); on 1st down: pass_medium 50%, play_action 50% (2 plays); on 3rd & 5+: none; last plays: 1&10 pass_medium | 1&10 play_action | 2&10 pass_medium.\nYour defense so far: overall: base 33%, blitz 33%, cover2 33% (3 plays); on 1st down: base 50%, cover2 50% (2 plays); on 3rd & 5+: none; last plays: 1&10 base | 1&10 cover2 | 2&10 blitz.\nRESULTS of their offense against you so far (success = 40% of the distance on 1st down, 60% on 2nd, a first down on 3rd/4th): by their call: pass_medium 2 plays, 4.5 yds/play, 50% success; play_action 1 plays, 0.0 yds/play, 0% success. By your defense