 yourself on 4th down; a field goal beyond your kicker's range usually misses). Without a valid answer on 4th down you kick.\n- kneel: run out the clock (when ahead late). spike: stop the clock (costs a down).\n- target: preferred receiver for passes (wr1 is the best receiver; \"\" lets the QB choose).\n- tempo: hurry = no huddle, ~12 s between plays (when behind late); milk = use the whole play clock (when ahead late); normal otherwise."},{"n":16,"side":1,"situation":"You are the DEFENSE of Bot Rookie. Q1 9:40 left in the quarter. Score: Bot Rookie 3 - Challenger 0.\nDown: 4 & 8 at the offense's own 44. Timeouts: you 3, them 3.\nTheir OFFENSE so far: overall: run_inside 20%, pass_short 30%, pass_medium 20%, pass_deep 10%, play_action 20% (10 plays); on 1st down: run_inside 40%, pass_short 40%, play_action 20% (5 plays); on 3rd & 5+: pass_deep 100% (1 plays); last plays: 1&10 pass_short | 2&10 pass_medium | 1&10 pass_short | 1&10 run_inside | 2&8 pass_medium | 3&8 pass_deep.\nYour defense so far: overall: base 20%, cover2 20%, cover3 20%, man 40% (10 plays); on 1st down: base 20%, cover2 40%, cover3 20%, man 20% (5 plays); on 3rd & 5+: man 100% (1 plays); last plays: 1&10 cover2 | 2&10 man | 1&10 cover2 | 1&10 man | 2&8 man | 3&8 man.\nRESULTS of their offense against you so far (success = 40% of the distance on 1st down, 60% on 2nd, a first down on 3rd/4th): by their call: pass_short 3 plays, 7.3 yds/play, 66% success; run_inside 2 plays, 1.5 yds/play, 0% success; pass_medium 2 plays, -4.0 yds/play, 0% success, 1 turnovers; play_action 2 plays, 6.5 yds/play, 50% success; pass_deep 1 plays, 0.0 yds/play, 0% success. By your defense: man 4 plays, -1.5 yds/play, 0% success, 1 turnovers; base 2 plays, 7.0 yds/play, 50% success; cover2 2 plays, 6.0 yds/play, 50% success; cover3 2 plays, 5.0 yds/play, 50% success. Their runs vs passes: passes 8 plays, 3.4 yds/play, 37% success, 1 turnovers; runs 2 plays, 1.5 yds/play, 0% success.\nLast plays: Bora runs middle for 2. / In