, goal_line, prevent; = base; - cover2; -- man.\n- pass_medium: intermediate throw, 10-18 yards. vs defenses: ++ cover2, goal_line; + base, cover3; = man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- pass_deep: deep shot, 20+ yards (interceptions when it loses). vs defenses: ++ man, goal_line; + blitz; = base; - cover3; -- cover2, prevent.\n- screen: screen to the RB behind the rush. vs defenses: ++ blitz; + cover3, goal_line, prevent; = cover2; - base; -- man.\n- play_action: fake run, then a medium throw (better once 40%+ of your plays have been runs, worse if you never run). vs defenses: ++ base, goal_line; = cover2, cover3, man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- punt / field_goal: kick (choose them yourself on 4th down; a field goal beyond your kicker's range usually misses). Without a valid answer on 4th down you kick.\n- kneel: run out the clock (when ahead late). spike: stop the clock (costs a down).\n- target: preferred receiver for passes (wr1 is the best receiver; \"\" lets the QB choose).\n- tempo: hurry = no huddle, ~12 s between plays (when behind late); milk = use the whole play clock (when ahead late); normal otherwise."},{"n":26,"side":1,"situation":"You are the DEFENSE of Bot Rookie. Q1 5:25 left in the quarter. Score: Bot Rookie 10 - Challenger 0.\nDown: 1 & 10 at the defense's 33 (33 yards to the goal line). Timeouts: you 3, them 3.\nTheir OFFENSE so far: overall: run_inside 14%, run_outside 14%, pass_short 21%, pass_medium 14%, pass_deep 21%, play_action 14% (14 plays); on 1st down: run_inside 33%, run_outside 16%, pass_short 33%, play_action 16% (6 plays); on 3rd & 5+: pass_deep 100% (1 plays); last plays: 2&8 pass_medium | 3&8 pass_deep | 4&8 pass_deep | 1&10 run_outside | 2&8 run_outside | 3&4 pass_deep.\nYour defense so far: overall: base 14%, cover2 21%, cover3 14%, man 50% (14 plays); on 1st down: base 16%, cover2 50%, cover3 16%, man 16% (6 plays); on 3rd & 5+: man 100% (1 plays); last plays: 2&8 man | 3&8 man | 4&8 man | 1&10 cover2 | 2&8 man | 3&4 man.\nRESULTS of the