 66% success; vs man 2 plays, 9.5 yds/play, 50% success; vs base 1 plays, 17.0 yds/play, 100% success. Runs vs passes: passes 12 plays, 6.2 yds/play, 58% success.\nLast plays: INTERCEPTED! Southerly jumps the route on Siroco's throw for Chinook. / Mistral to Foehn for 15 yards. / Mistral to Foehn for 6 yards.\n","schema":"{\"play\":\"run_inside|run_outside|qb_sneak|pass_short|pass_medium|pass_deep|screen|play_action|punt|field_goal|kneel|spike\",\"target\":\"wr1|wr2|wr3|te|rb|\",\"tempo\":\"normal|hurry|milk\"}\n- run_inside: power run between the tackles. vs defenses: ++ cover2, prevent; = man; - base, cover3; -- blitz, goal_line.\n- run_outside: outside zone run to the edge. vs defenses: ++ man, prevent; + blitz; = cover2; - base, goal_line; -- cover3.\n- qb_sneak: QB push for 1-2 yards (3rd/4th & 1 only). vs defenses: ++ prevent; + cover2, man; = base, cover3; - blitz; -- goal_line.\n- pass_short: quick throw, 3-9 yards. vs defenses: ++ cover3; + blitz, goal_line, prevent; = base; - cover2; -- man.\n- pass_medium: intermediate throw, 10-18 yards. vs defenses: ++ cover2, goal_line; + base, cover3; = man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- pass_deep: deep shot, 20+ yards (interceptions when it loses). vs defenses: ++ man, goal_line; + blitz; = base; - cover3; -- cover2, prevent.\n- screen: screen to the RB behind the rush. vs defenses: ++ blitz; + cover3, goal_line, prevent; = cover2; - base; -- man.\n- play_action: fake run, then a medium throw (better once 40%+ of your plays have been runs, worse if you never run). vs defenses: ++ base, goal_line; = cover2, cover3, man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- punt / field_goal: kick (choose them yourself on 4th down; a field goal beyond your kicker's range usually misses). Without a valid answer on 4th down you kick.\n- kneel: run out the clock (when ahead late). spike: stop the clock (costs a down).\n- target: preferred receiver for passes (wr1 is the best receiver; \"\" lets the QB choose).\n- tempo: hurry = no huddle, ~12 s between plays (when behind late); milk = use the whole play clock (when ahead late); normal otherwise."},{"n":30,"side":0,"situation":"You are the DEFENSE of Challenger. Q1 3:21 left in the quarter. Score: Challenger 0 - Bot Rookie 10.\nDown: 3 & 4 at the offense's own 27. Timeouts: you 3, them 3.\nTheir OFFENSE so far: overall: pass_short 7%, pass_medium 38%, screen 46%, play_action 7% (13 plays); on 1st down: pass_medium 42%, screen 42%, play_action 14% (7 plays); on 3rd & 5+: pass_short 50%, screen 50% (2 plays); last plays: 1&6 pass_medium | 2&6 pass_medium | 3&6 pass_short | 1&10 screen | 1&10 screen | 2&4 screen.\nYour defense so far: overall: base 7%, blitz 46%, cover2 23%, man 23% (13 plays); on 1st down: base 14%, blitz 14%, cover2 42%, man 28% (7 plays); on 3rd & 5+: blitz 100% (2 plays); last plays: 1&6 man | 2&6 blitz | 3&6 blitz | 1&10 cover2 | 1&10 blitz | 2&4 man.\nRESULTS of their offense against you so far (success = 40% of the distance on 1st down, 60% on 2nd, a first down on 3rd/4th): by their call: screen 6 plays, 6.7 yds/play, 66% success; pass_medium 5 plays, 5.6 yds/play, 40% success; pass_short 1 plays, 6.0 yds/play, 100% success; play_action 1 plays, 0.0 yds/play, 0% success. By your defense: blitz 6 plays, 2.5 yds/play, 50% success; cover2 3 plays, 7.7 yds/play, 66% success; man 3 plays, 6.3 yds/play, 33% success; base 1 plays, 17.0 yds/play, 100% success. Their runs vs passes: passes 13 plays, 5.7 yds/play, 53% success.\nLast plays: Mistral to Foehn for 15 yards. / Mistral to Foehn for 6 yards. / Mistral to Foehn for 0 yards.\n","schema":"{\"call\":\"base|blitz|cover2|cover3|man|goal_line|prevent\"}\n- base: balanced 4-3; stops run_inside (-), run_outside (-), screen (-); beaten by pass_medium (+), play_action (++).\n- blitz: extra rushers; stops run_inside (--), qb_sneak (-), pass_medium (--), play_action (--); beaten by run_outside (+), pass_short (+), pass_deep (+), screen (++).\n- cover2: two deep safeties, light box; stops pass_short (-), pass_de