es). vs defenses: ++ man, goal_line; + blitz; = base; - cover3; -- cover2, prevent.\n- screen: screen to the RB behind the rush. vs defenses: ++ blitz; + cover3, goal_line, prevent; = cover2; - base; -- man.\n- play_action: fake run, then a medium throw (better once 40%+ of your plays have been runs, worse if you never run). vs defenses: ++ base, goal_line; = cover2, cover3, man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- punt / field_goal: kick (choose them yourself on 4th down; a field goal beyond your kicker's range usually misses). Without a valid answer on 4th down you kick.\n- kneel: run out the clock (when ahead late). spike: stop the clock (costs a down).\n- target: preferred receiver for passes (wr1 is the best receiver; \"\" lets the QB choose).\n- tempo: hurry = no huddle, ~12 s between plays (when behind late); milk = use the whole play clock (when ahead late); normal otherwise."},{"n":42,"side":1,"situation":"You are the DEFENSE of Bot Rookie. Q2 12:46 left in the quarter. Score: Bot Rookie 17 - Challenger 0.\nDown: 2 & 8 at the defense's 20 (20 yards to the goal line). Timeouts: you 3, them 3.\nTheir OFFENSE so far: overall: run_inside 22%, run_outside 11%, pass_short 16%, pass_medium 11%, pass_deep 27%, play_action 11% (18 plays); on 1st down: run_inside 44%, run_outside 11%, pass_short 22%, pass_deep 11%, play_action 11% (9 plays); on 3rd & 5+: pass_deep 100% (1 plays); last plays: 2&8 run_outside | 3&4 pass_deep | 1&10 pass_deep | 1&10 run_inside | 2&5 pass_deep | 1&10 run_inside.\nYour defense so far: overall: base 11%, cover2 27%, cover3 16%, man 44% (18 plays); on 1st down: base 11%, cover2 44%, cover3 22%, man 22% (9 plays); on 3rd & 5+: man 100% (1 plays); last plays: 2&8 man | 3&4 man | 1&10 cover3 | 1&10 cover2 | 2&5 cover2 | 1&10 man.\nRESULTS of their offense against you so far (success = 40% of the distance on 1st down, 60% on 2nd, a first down on 3rd/4th): by their call: pass_deep 5 plays, 19.2 yds/play, 40% success, 1 turnovers; run_inside 4 plays, 2.5 yds