ses: passes 27 plays, 6.3 yds/play, 55% success; runs 1 plays, -1.0 yds/play, 0% success.\nLast plays: Mistral to Zonda for 14 yards. / Incomplete: Mistral's pass for Zonda falls to the turf. / Incomplete: Mistral's pass for Zonda falls to the turf.\n","schema":"{\"play\":\"run_inside|run_outside|qb_sneak|pass_short|pass_medium|pass_deep|screen|play_action|punt|field_goal|kneel|spike\",\"target\":\"wr1|wr2|wr3|te|rb|\",\"tempo\":\"normal|hurry|milk\"}\n- run_inside: power run between the tackles. vs defenses: ++ cover2, prevent; = man; - base, cover3; -- blitz, goal_line.\n- run_outside: outside zone run to the edge. vs defenses: ++ man, prevent; + blitz; = cover2; - base, goal_line; -- cover3.\n- qb_sneak: QB push for 1-2 yards (3rd/4th & 1 only). vs defenses: ++ prevent; + cover2, man; = base, cover3; - blitz; -- goal_line.\n- pass_short: quick throw, 3-9 yards. vs defenses: ++ cover3; + blitz, goal_line, prevent; = base; - cover2; -- man.\n- pass_medium: intermediate throw, 10-18 yards. vs defenses: ++ cover2, goal_line; + base, cover3; = man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- pass_deep: deep shot, 20+ yards (interceptions when it loses). vs defenses: ++ man, goal_line; + blitz; = base; - cover3; -- cover2, prevent.\n- screen: screen to the RB behind the rush. vs defenses: ++ blitz; + cover3, goal_line, prevent; = cover2; - base; -- man.\n- play_action: fake run, then a medium throw (better once 40%+ of your plays have been runs, worse if you never run). vs defenses: ++ base, goal_line; = cover2, cover3, man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- punt / field_goal: kick (choose them yourself on 4th down; a field goal beyond your kicker's range usually misses). Without a valid answer on 4th down you kick.\n- kneel: run out the clock (when ahead late). spike: stop the clock (costs a down).\n- target: preferred receiver for passes (wr1 is the best receiver; \"\" lets the QB choose).\n- tempo: hurry = no huddle, ~12 s between plays (when behind late); milk = use the whole play clock (when ahead late); normal otherwise."},{"n":52,"side":0,"situation":"You are the DEFENSE of Challenger. Q2 10:07 left in the quarter. Score: Challenger 7 - Bot Rookie 17.\nDown: 4 & 10 at midfield. Timeouts: you 3, them 3.\nTheir OFFENSE so far: overall: run_outside 3%, pass_short 6%, pass_medium 41%, screen 44%, play_action 3% (29 plays); on 1st down: run_outside 7%, pass_medium 53%, screen 30%, play_action 7% (13 plays); on 3rd & 5+: pass_short 33%, screen 66% (3 plays); last plays: 2&2 pass_medium | 3&2 screen | 4&2 pass_short | 1&10 pass_medium | 2&10 pass_medium | 3&10 screen.\nYour defense so far: overall: base 3%, blitz 34%, cover2 13%, cover3 6%, man 41% (29 plays); on 1st down: base 7%, blitz 23%, cover2 30%, cover3 7%, man 30% (13 plays); on 3rd & 5+: blitz 66%, man 33% (3 plays); last plays: 2&2 man | 3&2 man | 4&2 man | 1&10 blitz | 2&10 blitz | 3&10 man.\nRESULTS of their offense against you so far (success = 40% of the distance on 1st down, 60% on 2nd, a first down on 3rd/4th): by their call: screen 13 plays, 6.8 yds/play, 61% success; pass_medium 12 plays, 5.2 yds/play, 41% success; pass_short 2 plays, 10.0 yds/play, 100% success; run_outside 1 plays, -1.0 yds/play, 0% success; play_action 1 plays, 0.0 yds/play, 0% success. By your defense: man 12 plays, 6.7 yds/play, 50% success; blitz 10 plays, 2.3 yds/play, 40% success; cover2 4 plays, 7.8 yds/play, 75% success; cover3 2 plays, 9.0 yds/play, 50% success; base 1 plays, 17.0 yds/play, 100% success. Their runs vs passes: passes 28 plays, 6.1 yds/play, 53% success; runs 1 plays, -1.0 yds/play, 0% success.\nLast plays: Incomplete: Mistral's pass for Zonda falls to the turf. / Incomplete: Mistral's pass for Zonda falls to the turf. / Incomplete: Mistral's pass for Foehn falls to the turf.\n","schema":"{\"call\":\"base|blitz|cover2|cover3|man|goal_line|prevent\"}\n- base: balanced 4-3; stops run_inside (-), run_outside (-), screen (-); beaten by pass_medium (+), play_action (++).\n- blitz: extra rushers; stops r