w, 10-18 yards. vs defenses: ++ cover2, goal_line; + base, cover3; = man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- pass_deep: deep shot, 20+ yards (interceptions when it loses). vs defenses: ++ man, goal_line; + blitz; = base; - cover3; -- cover2, prevent.\n- screen: screen to the RB behind the rush. vs defenses: ++ blitz; + cover3, goal_line, prevent; = cover2; - base; -- man.\n- play_action: fake run, then a medium throw (better once 40%+ of your plays have been runs, worse if you never run). vs defenses: ++ base, goal_line; = cover2, cover3, man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- punt / field_goal: kick (choose them yourself on 4th down; a field goal beyond your kicker's range usually misses). Without a valid answer on 4th down you kick.\n- kneel: run out the clock (when ahead late). spike: stop the clock (costs a down).\n- target: preferred receiver for passes (wr1 is the best receiver; \"\" lets the QB choose).\n- tempo: hurry = no huddle, ~12 s between plays (when behind late); milk = use the whole play clock (when ahead late); normal otherwise."},{"n":61,"side":0,"situation":"You are the DEFENSE of Challenger. Q2 7:04 left in the quarter. Score: Challenger 7 - Bot Rookie 17.\nDown: 2 & 10 at the defense's 23 (23 yards to the goal line). Timeouts: you 3, them 3.\nTheir OFFENSE so far: overall: run_outside 2%, pass_short 13%, pass_medium 37%, pass_deep 2%, screen 40%, play_action 2% (37 plays); on 1st down: run_outside 5%, pass_short 11%, pass_medium 38%, pass_deep 5%, screen 33%, play_action 5% (18 plays); on 3rd & 5+: pass_short 33%, screen 66% (3 plays); last plays: 1&10 pass_short | 2&10 pass_short | 1&10 pass_short | 2&10 pass_medium | 1&10 screen | 1&10 pass_deep.\nYour defense so far: overall: base 2%, blitz 37%, cover2 10%, cover3 8%, man 40% (37 plays); on 1st down: base 5%, blitz 33%, cover2 22%, cover3 11%, man 27% (18 plays); on 3rd & 5+: blitz 66%, man 33% (3 plays); last plays: 1&10 cover3 | 2&10 man | 1&10 man | 2&10 man | 1&10 blitz | 1&10 blitz.\nRESULTS of their offense