over3, man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- punt / field_goal: kick (choose them yourself on 4th down; a field goal beyond your kicker's range usually misses). Without a valid answer on 4th down you kick.\n- kneel: run out the clock (when ahead late). spike: stop the clock (costs a down).\n- target: preferred receiver for passes (wr1 is the best receiver; \"\" lets the QB choose).\n- tempo: hurry = no huddle, ~12 s between plays (when behind late); milk = use the whole play clock (when ahead late); normal otherwise."},{"n":90,"side":1,"situation":"You are the DEFENSE of Bot Rookie. Q3 9:56 left in the quarter. Score: Bot Rookie 20 - Challenger 14.\nDown: 2 & 18 at the defense's 31 (31 yards to the goal line). Timeouts: you 3, them 3.\nTheir OFFENSE so far: overall: run_inside 14%, run_outside 11%, qb_sneak 2%, pass_short 14%, pass_medium 26%, pass_deep 20%, play_action 8% (34 plays); on 1st down: run_inside 31%, run_outside 12%, pass_short 12%, pass_medium 12%, pass_deep 18%, play_action 12% (16 plays); on 3rd & 5+: pass_deep 100% (1 plays); last plays: 4&2 pass_medium | 1&10 pass_deep | 1&1 play_action | 2&9 pass_medium | 3&1 qb_sneak | 1&10 pass_medium.\nYour defense so far: overall: base 8%, cover2 20%, cover3 20%, man 32%, goal_line 17% (34 plays); on 1st down: base 12%, cover2 31%, cover3 31%, man 18%, goal_line 6% (16 plays); on 3rd & 5+: man 100% (1 plays); last plays: 4&2 goal_line | 1&10 cover3 | 1&1 goal_line | 2&9 goal_line | 3&1 goal_line | 1&10 cover2.\nRESULTS of their offense against you so far (success = 40% of the distance on 1st down, 60% on 2nd, a first down on 3rd/4th): by their call: pass_medium 9 plays, 6.6 yds/play, 44% success, 1 turnovers; pass_deep 7 plays, 23.6 yds/play, 42% success, 2 turnovers; run_inside 5 plays, 3.6 yds/play, 40% success; pass_short 5 plays, 4.4 yds/play, 40% success; run_outside 4 plays, 2.2 yds/play, 25% success; play_action 3 plays, 1.7 yds/play, 33% success; qb_sneak 1 plays, 1.0 yds/play, 100% success. By your defense: ma