= base; - cover3; -- cover2, prevent.\n- screen: screen to the RB behind the rush. vs defenses: ++ blitz; + cover3, goal_line, prevent; = cover2; - base; -- man.\n- play_action: fake run, then a medium throw (better once 40%+ of your plays have been runs, worse if you never run). vs defenses: ++ base, goal_line; = cover2, cover3, man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- punt / field_goal: kick (choose them yourself on 4th down; a field goal beyond your kicker's range usually misses). Without a valid answer on 4th down you kick.\n- kneel: run out the clock (when ahead late). spike: stop the clock (costs a down).\n- target: preferred receiver for passes (wr1 is the best receiver; \"\" lets the QB choose).\n- tempo: hurry = no huddle, ~12 s between plays (when behind late); milk = use the whole play clock (when ahead late); normal otherwise."},{"n":94,"side":0,"situation":"You are the DEFENSE of Challenger. Q3 8:56 left in the quarter. Score: Challenger 17 - Bot Rookie 20.\nDown: 2 & 1 at the offense's own 28. Timeouts: you 3, them 3.\nTheir OFFENSE so far: overall: run_outside 1%, pass_short 12%, pass_medium 37%, pass_deep 1%, screen 44%, play_action 1% (54 plays); on 1st down: run_outside 4%, pass_short 12%, pass_medium 36%, pass_deep 4%, screen 40%, play_action 4% (25 plays); on 3rd & 5+: pass_short 16%, pass_medium 16%, screen 66% (6 plays); last plays: 4&10 screen | 1&10 screen | 2&10 pass_short | 3&15 screen | 4&17 screen | 1&10 pass_short.\nYour defense so far: overall: base 1%, blitz 40%, cover2 9%, cover3 9%, man 38% (54 plays); on 1st down: base 4%, blitz 32%, cover2 20%, cover3 16%, man 28% (25 plays); on 3rd & 5+: blitz 66%, man 33% (6 plays); last plays: 4&10 blitz | 1&10 cover3 | 2&10 blitz | 3&15 man | 4&17 man | 1&10 blitz.\nRESULTS of their offense against you so far (success = 40% of the distance on 1st down, 60% on 2nd, a first down on 3rd/4th): by their call: screen 24 plays, 7.0 yds/play, 54% success; pass_medium 20 plays, 5.8 yds/play, 40% success; pass_short