e, goal_line; = cover2, cover3, man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- punt / field_goal: kick (choose them yourself on 4th down; a field goal beyond your kicker's range usually misses). Without a valid answer on 4th down you kick.\n- kneel: run out the clock (when ahead late). spike: stop the clock (costs a down).\n- target: preferred receiver for passes (wr1 is the best receiver; \"\" lets the QB choose).\n- tempo: hurry = no huddle, ~12 s between plays (when behind late); milk = use the whole play clock (when ahead late); normal otherwise."},{"n":118,"side":1,"situation":"You are the DEFENSE of Bot Rookie. Q4 13:42 left in the quarter. Score: Bot Rookie 20 - Challenger 17.\nDown: 1 & 10 at the defense's 13 (13 yards to the goal line). Timeouts: you 3, them 3.\nTheir OFFENSE so far: overall: run_inside 21%, run_outside 8%, qb_sneak 2%, pass_short 15%, pass_medium 26%, pass_deep 19%, play_action 6% (46 plays); on 1st down: run_inside 42%, run_outside 9%, pass_short 14%, pass_medium 9%, pass_deep 14%, play_action 9% (21 plays); on 3rd & 5+: pass_medium 33%, pass_deep 66% (3 plays); last plays: 3&19 pass_medium | 1&10 run_inside | 2&2 run_inside | 1&10 run_inside | 1&10 run_inside | 2&11 pass_medium.\nYour defense so far: overall: base 8%, blitz 2%, cover2 23%, cover3 17%, man 28%, goal_line 13%, prevent 6% (46 plays); on 1st down: base 14%, cover2 38%, cover3 28%, man 14%, goal_line 4% (21 plays); on 3rd & 5+: man 33%, prevent 66% (3 plays); last plays: 3&19 prevent | 1&10 cover2 | 2&2 man | 1&10 cover2 | 1&10 base | 2&11 man.\nRESULTS of their offense against you so far (success = 40% of the distance on 1st down, 60% on 2nd, a first down on 3rd/4th): by their call: pass_medium 12 plays, 5.7 yds/play, 41% success, 1 turnovers; run_inside 10 plays, 5.1 yds/play, 50% success; pass_deep 9 plays, 18.3 yds/play, 33% success, 2 turnovers; pass_short 7 plays, 4.4 yds/play, 42% success; run_outside 4 plays, 2.2 yds/play, 25% success; play_action 3 plays, 1.7 yds/play, 33% success; qb