ys, 5.2 yds/play, 35% success, 1 turnovers; vs cover2 11 plays, 10.3 yds/play, 54% success; vs cover3 8 plays, 12.2 yds/play, 50% success, 1 turnovers; vs goal_line 7 plays, -1.0 yds/play, 28% success; vs base 4 plays, 11.0 yds/play, 25% success, 1 turnovers; vs prevent 4 plays, -1.5 yds/play, 0% success; vs blitz 1 plays, 9.0 yds/play, 100% success. Runs vs passes: passes 34 plays, 7.7 yds/play, 35% success, 3 turnovers; runs 15 plays, 4.1 yds/play, 46% success.\nLast plays: Incomplete: Siroco's pass for Chinook falls to the turf. / Incomplete: Siroco's pass for Chinook falls to the turf. / SACK! Ostro brings down Siroco for a loss of 6.\n","schema":"{\"play\":\"run_inside|run_outside|qb_sneak|pass_short|pass_medium|pass_deep|screen|play_action|punt|field_goal|kneel|spike\",\"target\":\"wr1|wr2|wr3|te|rb|\",\"tempo\":\"normal|hurry|milk\"}\n- run_inside: power run between the tackles. vs defenses: ++ cover2, prevent; = man; - base, cover3; -- blitz, goal_line.\n- run_outside: outside zone run to the edge. vs defenses: ++ man, prevent; + blitz; = cover2; - base, goal_line; -- cover3.\n- qb_sneak: QB push for 1-2 yards (3rd/4th & 1 only). vs defenses: ++ prevent; + cover2, man; = base, cover3; - blitz; -- goal_line.\n- pass_short: quick throw, 3-9 yards. vs defenses: ++ cover3; + blitz, goal_line, prevent; = base; - cover2; -- man.\n- pass_medium: intermediate throw, 10-18 yards. vs defenses: ++ cover2, goal_line; + base, cover3; = man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- pass_deep: deep shot, 20+ yards (interceptions when it loses). vs defenses: ++ man, goal_line; + blitz; = base; - cover3; -- cover2, prevent.\n- screen: screen to the RB behind the rush. vs defenses: ++ blitz; + cover3, goal_line, prevent; = cover2; - base; -- man.\n- play_action: fake run, then a medium throw (better once 40%+ of your plays have been runs, worse if you never run). vs defenses: ++ base, goal_line; = cover2, cover3, man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- punt / field_goal: kick (choose them yourself on 4th down; a field goal beyond your kicker's range usually misses). Without a valid answer on 4th down you kick.\n- kneel: run out the clock (when ahead late). spike: stop the clock (costs a down).\n- target: preferred receiver for passes (wr1 is the best receiver; \"\" lets the QB choose).\n- tempo: hurry = no huddle, ~12 s between plays (when behind late); milk = use the whole play clock (when ahead late); normal otherwise."},{"n":121,"side":1,"situation":"You are the DEFENSE of Bot Rookie. Q4 12:53 left in the quarter. Score: Bot Rookie 20 - Challenger 17.\nDown: 4 & 16 at the defense's 19 (19 yards to the goal line). Timeouts: you 3, them 3.\nTheir OFFENSE so far: overall: run_inside 20%, run_outside 8%, qb_sneak 2%, pass_short 14%, pass_medium 30%, pass_deep 18%, play_action 6% (49 plays); on 1st down: run_inside 40%, run_outside 9%, pass_short 13%, pass_medium 13%, pass_deep 13%, play_action 9% (22 plays); on 3rd & 5+: pass_medium 50%, pass_deep 50% (4 plays); last plays: 1&10 run_inside | 1&10 run_inside | 2&11 pass_medium | 1&10 pass_medium | 2&10 pass_medium | 3&10 pass_medium.\nYour defense so far: overall: base 8%, blitz 2%, cover2 22%, cover3 16%, man 28%, goal_line 14%, prevent 8% (49 plays); on 1st down: base 13%, cover2 36%, cover3 27%, man 13%, goal_line 9% (22 plays); on 3rd & 5+: man 25%, prevent 75% (4 plays); last plays: 1&10 cover2 | 1&10 base | 2&11 man | 1&10 goal_line | 2&10 man | 3&10 prevent.\nRESULTS of their offense against you so far (success = 40% of the distance on 1st down, 60% on 2nd, a first down on 3rd/4th): by their call: pass_medium 15 plays, 4.1 yds/play, 33% success, 1 turnovers; run_inside 10 plays, 5.1 yds/play, 50% success; pass_deep 9 plays, 18.3 yds/play, 33% success, 2 turnovers; pass_short 7 plays, 4.4 yds/play, 42% success; run_outside 4 plays, 2.2 yds/play, 25% success; play_action 3 plays, 1.7 yds/play, 33% success; qb_sneak 1 plays, 1.0 yds/play, 100% success. By your defense: man 14 plays, 5.2 yds/play, 35% success, 1 