e the whole play clock (when ahead late); normal otherwise."},{"n":129,"side":1,"situation":"You are the DEFENSE of Bot Rookie. Q4 9:22 left in the quarter. Score: Bot Rookie 20 - Challenger 20.\nDown: 1 & goal at the defense's 7 (7 yards to the goal line). Timeouts: you 3, them 3.\nTheir OFFENSE so far: overall: run_inside 22%, run_outside 9%, qb_sneak 1%, pass_short 12%, pass_medium 31%, pass_deep 16%, play_action 5% (54 plays); on 1st down: run_inside 45%, run_outside 8%, pass_short 12%, pass_medium 12%, pass_deep 12%, play_action 8% (24 plays); on 3rd & 5+: pass_medium 60%, pass_deep 40% (5 plays); last plays: 3&10 pass_medium | 1&10 run_inside | 2&10 run_outside | 3&5 pass_medium | 1&10 run_inside | 2&5 pass_medium.\nYour defense so far: overall: base 7%, blitz 7%, cover2 22%, cover3 14%, man 27%, goal_line 12%, prevent 7% (54 plays); on 1st down: base 12%, blitz 4%, cover2 37%, cover3 25%, man 12%, goal_line 8% (24 plays); on 3rd & 5+: blitz 20%, man 20%, prevent 60% (5 plays); last plays: 3&10 prevent | 1&10 blitz | 2&10 blitz | 3&5 blitz | 1&10 cover2 | 2&5 man.\nRESULTS of their offense against you so far (success = 40% of the distance on 1st down, 60% on 2nd, a first down on 3rd/4th): by their call: pass_medium 17 plays, 5.0 yds/play, 41% success, 1 turnovers; run_inside 12 plays, 4.7 yds/play, 50% success; pass_deep 9 plays, 18.3 yds/play, 33% success, 2 turnovers; pass_short 7 plays, 4.4 yds/play, 42% success; run_outside 5 plays, 2.8 yds/play, 20% success; play_action 3 plays, 1.7 yds/play, 33% success; qb_sneak 1 plays, 1.0 yds/play, 100% success. By your defense: man 15 plays, 5.5 yds/play, 40% success, 1 turnovers; cover2 12 plays, 9.8 yds/play, 58% success; cover3 8 plays, 12.2 yds/play, 50% success, 1 turnovers; goal_line 7 plays, -1.0 yds/play, 28% success; base 4 plays, 11.0 yds/play, 25% success, 1 turnovers; blitz 4 plays, 6.8 yds/play, 50% success; prevent 4 plays, -1.5 yds/play, 0% success. Their runs vs passes: passes 36 plays, 7.9 yds/play,