hort: quick throw, 3-9 yards. vs defenses: ++ cover3; + blitz, goal_line, prevent; = base; - cover2; -- man.\n- pass_medium: intermediate throw, 10-18 yards. vs defenses: ++ cover2, goal_line; + base, cover3; = man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- pass_deep: deep shot, 20+ yards (interceptions when it loses). vs defenses: ++ man, goal_line; + blitz; = base; - cover3; -- cover2, prevent.\n- screen: screen to the RB behind the rush. vs defenses: ++ blitz; + cover3, goal_line, prevent; = cover2; - base; -- man.\n- play_action: fake run, then a medium throw (better once 40%+ of your plays have been runs, worse if you never run). vs defenses: ++ base, goal_line; = cover2, cover3, man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- punt / field_goal: kick (choose them yourself on 4th down; a field goal beyond your kicker's range usually misses). Without a valid answer on 4th down you kick.\n- kneel: run out the clock (when ahead late). spike: stop the clock (costs a down).\n- target: preferred receiver for passes (wr1 is the best receiver; \"\" lets the QB choose).\n- tempo: hurry = no huddle, ~12 s between plays (when behind late); milk = use the whole play clock (when ahead late); normal otherwise."},{"n":138,"side":0,"situation":"You are the DEFENSE of Challenger. Q4 7:14 left in the quarter. Score: Challenger 30 - Bot Rookie 20.\nDown: 2 & 14 at the offense's own 26. Timeouts: you 3, them 3.\nTheir OFFENSE so far: overall: run_outside 1%, qb_sneak 1%, pass_short 14%, pass_medium 39%, pass_deep 1%, screen 40%, play_action 1% (71 plays); on 1st down: run_outside 2%, pass_short 11%, pass_medium 45%, pass_deep 2%, screen 34%, play_action 2% (35 plays); on 3rd & 5+: pass_short 16%, pass_medium 16%, screen 66% (6 plays); last plays: 1&10 screen | 2&10 screen | 1&10 pass_medium | 2&10 pass_medium | 1&10 pass_medium | 1&10 pass_short.\nYour defense so far: overall: base 1%, blitz 39%, cover2 7%, cover3 12%, man 39% (71 plays); on 1st down: base 2%, blitz 31%, cover2 14%, cover3 22%, man 28% (35 plays); on 