 no huddle, ~12 s between plays (when behind late); milk = use the whole play clock (when ahead late); normal otherwise."},{"n":148,"side":1,"situation":"You are the DEFENSE of Bot Rookie. Q4 4:15 left in the quarter. Score: Bot Rookie 20 - Challenger 30.\nDown: 4 & 11 at the offense's own 26. Timeouts: you 3, them 3.\nTheir OFFENSE so far: overall: run_inside 22%, run_outside 7%, qb_sneak 3%, pass_short 12%, pass_medium 33%, pass_deep 14%, screen 1%, play_action 4% (63 plays); on 1st down: run_inside 48%, run_outside 7%, pass_short 11%, pass_medium 14%, pass_deep 11%, play_action 7% (27 plays); on 3rd & 5+: pass_medium 57%, pass_deep 28%, screen 14% (7 plays); last plays: 1&10 run_inside | 2&6 pass_medium | 3&6 pass_medium | 1&10 run_inside | 2&9 pass_short | 3&9 screen.\nYour defense so far: overall: base 6%, blitz 12%, cover2 19%, cover3 14%, man 25%, goal_line 14%, prevent 7% (63 plays); on 1st down: base 11%, blitz 7%, cover2 33%, cover3 25%, man 11%, goal_line 11% (27 plays); on 3rd & 5+: blitz 28%, man 14%, prevent 57% (7 plays); last plays: 1&10 blitz | 2&6 blitz | 3&6 prevent | 1&10 cover3 | 2&9 blitz | 3&9 blitz.\nRESULTS of their offense against you so far (success = 40% of the distance on 1st down, 60% on 2nd, a first down on 3rd/4th): by their call: pass_medium 21 plays, 4.3 yds/play, 38% success, 1 turnovers; run_inside 14 plays, 4.4 yds/play, 50% success; pass_deep 9 plays, 18.3 yds/play, 33% success, 2 turnovers; pass_short 8 plays, 3.9 yds/play, 37% success; run_outside 5 plays, 2.8 yds/play, 20% success; play_action 3 plays, 1.7 yds/play, 33% success; qb_sneak 2 plays, 1.0 yds/play, 100% success; screen 1 plays, -2.0 yds/play, 0% success. By your defense: man 16 plays, 5.6 yds/play, 43% success, 1 turnovers; cover2 12 plays, 9.8 yds/play, 58% success; cover3 9 plays, 11.0 yds/play, 44% success, 1 turnovers; goal_line 9 plays, -0.7 yds/play, 33% success; blitz 8 plays, 3.6 yds/play, 37% success; prevent 5 plays, -1.2 yds/play, 0% success; base 4 pla