le, ~12 s between plays (when behind late); milk = use the whole play clock (when ahead late); normal otherwise."},{"n":154,"side":0,"situation":"You are the DEFENSE of Challenger. Q4 3:13 left in the quarter. Score: Challenger 30 - Bot Rookie 20.\nDown: 1 & 10 at the defense's 22 (22 yards to the goal line). Timeouts: you 3, them 3.\nTheir OFFENSE so far: overall: run_outside 1%, qb_sneak 1%, pass_short 16%, pass_medium 36%, pass_deep 3%, screen 39%, play_action 1% (83 plays); on 1st down: run_outside 2%, pass_short 10%, pass_medium 41%, pass_deep 7%, screen 35%, play_action 2% (39 plays); on 3rd & 5+: pass_short 44%, pass_medium 11%, screen 44% (9 plays); last plays: 4&8 pass_medium | 1&10 pass_deep | 2&10 screen | 3&5 pass_short | 4&5 screen | 1&10 pass_deep.\nYour defense so far: overall: base 1%, blitz 39%, cover2 6%, cover3 12%, man 40% (83 plays); on 1st down: base 2%, blitz 30%, cover2 12%, cover3 23%, man 30% (39 plays); on 3rd & 5+: blitz 66%, man 33% (9 plays); last plays: 4&8 man | 1&10 man | 2&10 blitz | 3&5 blitz | 4&5 man | 1&10 blitz.\nRESULTS of their offense against you so far (success = 40% of the distance on 1st down, 60% on 2nd, a first down on 3rd/4th): by their call: screen 33 plays, 6.2 yds/play, 48% success, 1 turnovers; pass_medium 30 plays, 6.5 yds/play, 36% success, 4 turnovers; pass_short 14 plays, 4.7 yds/play, 50% success; pass_deep 3 plays, 13.3 yds/play, 33% success; run_outside 1 plays, -1.0 yds/play, 0% success; qb_sneak 1 plays, 2.0 yds/play, 100% success; play_action 1 plays, 0.0 yds/play, 0% success. By your defense: man 34 plays, 5.7 yds/play, 44% success, 3 turnovers; blitz 33 plays, 5.8 yds/play, 39% success, 1 turnovers; cover3 10 plays, 6.3 yds/play, 30% success, 1 turnovers; cover2 5 plays, 8.6 yds/play, 80% success; base 1 plays, 17.0 yds/play, 100% success. Their runs vs passes: passes 81 plays, 6.3 yds/play, 43% success, 5 turnovers; runs 2 plays, 0.5 yds/play, 50% success.\nLast plays: Incomplete: Mistral's pass for Zo