en it loses). vs defenses: ++ man, goal_line; + blitz; = base; - cover3; -- cover2, prevent.\n- screen: screen to the RB behind the rush. vs defenses: ++ blitz; + cover3, goal_line, prevent; = cover2; - base; -- man.\n- play_action: fake run, then a medium throw (better once 40%+ of your plays have been runs, worse if you never run). vs defenses: ++ base, goal_line; = cover2, cover3, man; - prevent; -- blitz.\n- punt / field_goal: kick (choose them yourself on 4th down; a field goal beyond your kicker's range usually misses). Without a valid answer on 4th down you kick.\n- kneel: run out the clock (when ahead late). spike: stop the clock (costs a down).\n- target: preferred receiver for passes (wr1 is the best receiver; \"\" lets the QB choose).\n- tempo: hurry = no huddle, ~12 s between plays (when behind late); milk = use the whole play clock (when ahead late); normal otherwise."},{"n":165,"side":0,"situation":"You are the DEFENSE of Challenger. Q4 1:54 left in the quarter. Score: Challenger 30 - Bot Rookie 20.\nDown: 1 & 10 at the defense's 31 (31 yards to the goal line). Timeouts: you 3, them 0.\nTheir OFFENSE so far: overall: run_outside 1%, qb_sneak 1%, pass_short 17%, pass_medium 36%, pass_deep 4%, screen 37%, play_action 1% (90 plays); on 1st down: run_outside 2%, pass_short 9%, pass_medium 41%, pass_deep 9%, screen 34%, play_action 2% (41 plays); on 3rd & 5+: pass_short 50%, pass_medium 10%, screen 40% (10 plays); last plays: 2&10 pass_medium | 3&10 pass_short | 4&5 pass_medium | 1&10 pass_deep | 2&10 screen | 3&1 pass_short.\nYour defense so far: overall: base 1%, blitz 36%, cover2 5%, cover3 15%, man 41% (90 plays); on 1st down: base 2%, blitz 29%, cover2 12%, cover3 24%, man 31% (41 plays); on 3rd & 5+: blitz 60%, man 40% (10 plays); last plays: 2&10 man | 3&10 man | 4&5 cover3 | 1&10 cover3 | 2&10 cover3 | 3&1 cover3.\nRESULTS of their offense against you so far (success = 40% of the distance on 1st down, 60% on 2nd, a first down on 3rd/4th): by their c